  "description": "Assault, drugs, parties… Kwon Hyuk, the uncontrollable heir of Ranseong Group's owner family, brings controversy wherever he goes. Upon entering the company as a new employee at his father’s command, he meets his workplace mentor, Oh Yeon-soo. Intending to get back at his father, Hyuk decides to mess with Yeon-soo, but…\n\n*“Shall we have a threesome?”*\n\nYeon-soo, who seemed so innocent, was hiding a double life.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/new_employee)",
